From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:46:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: an7552: fix spi0 alias in an7552.dtsi

The SPI-NAND controller node in an7552.dtsi is labeled spi0, not snfi.
Fix the aliases entry so boards including an7552.dtsi compile cleanly.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm/dts/an7552.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/arch/arm/dts/an7552.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/an7552.dtsi
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@
 
 	aliases {
 		serial0 = &uart1;
-		spi0 = &snfi;
+		spi0 = &spi0;
 		ethernet0 = &gdm1;
 	};
